# Private firmware libraries

This directory is currently empty. Keep reusable project-owned embedded
libraries here only when `src/main.cpp` is split for a concrete reason. Third-
party dependencies belong in pinned `platformio.ini` `lib_deps`, not copied
into this directory.

If a project-owned library is added, document its public interface, ownership,
test target, memory impact, and whether it is included in the signed fleet
artifact before merging.
